            "review_title": "Review at The Elephant",
            "review_text": "Leean W\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam206 contributions\n0\nPleasant Enough at The Elephant\nDec 2020\nWe have only visited once so in fairness we have not sampled much of the Elephant's bar food. Basically we shared some bar snacks between us, some French fries, a chicken wrap, a salad and some Mozzarella cheese sticks. The food was pleasant enough and hit the spot. The staff were lovely - welcoming, helpful and friendly. Even the owner came up and made us especially welcome as he hadn't seen us before. It is for that reason that we will go back but next time we will make sure that we sample the Elephant's dinner options rater than snacks and give the food another chance. But definitely a nice little spot to visit, for a drink, snacks, or more.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 15, 2021",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-13",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
