            "review_title": "Review at The Elephant",
            "review_text": "Philippe S\n7 contributions\n1\nORDER NOT COMPLETE\nMay 2020 • Family\nWe ordered 2 Mexican Wrapp and one Grec Chicken and Tzatziki wrap + 2 portions of French fries.\n\nWe did not receive The French fries and any sauce or towels - nothing.\n\nWe called 2 times and even being polite They hung up the phone Each times - saying « no speaking English »\n\nWe are regular customers at their place and this is the third times that we order for a delivery - this is not correct and inacceptable.\nAny apologies - nothing!\n\nPhilippe SAINTAGNE\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 27, 2020",
