            "review_title": "Review at The Elephant",
            "review_text": "katanankes\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam90 contributions\n0\nGreat comfort food\nMar 2016 • Solo\nI enjoyed the Elephant in various occations. It is a nice departure from the boring offering of Korean food that is ubiquitous in Phu My Hung. \n\nThe main attraction of the menu is the Kebab like sandwitches with meat and other fillings. They alone can make a meal. I tried it a couple of times.\n\nSeating is bit limited. Worth visiting on a cool evening when you can enjoy sitting outside.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten June 29, 2016",
